---
import { Code } from 'astro:components';

const nodeSchemaCode = `message Node {
  uint32 id = 16;  // 5,000,000 (4B int)
  bool active = 3; // true
  string city = 9; // "FRA" (Target)
}`;
---

<section
  id="how-it-works"
  class="py-12 sm:py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto border-t-2 border-ink/15"
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mb-8">
    <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight uppercase leading-none">
      Why the encoding{' '}
      <span class="font-serif italic font-normal normal-case text-[#FF4F18]">is so fast.</span>
    </h2>
  </div>

  <div class="border-t-2 border-ink divide-y-2 divide-ink/20">
    <!-- Row 1: Read integers without byte-by-byte loops -->
    <div class="py-8 sm:py-10 grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 lg:gap-8 items-center">
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-3 min-w-0">
        <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight leading-snug">
          Read integers without byte-by-byte loops
        </h3>
        <!-- prettier-ignore -->
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-ink/85 leading-relaxed max-w-[65ch]">
          Instead of checking continuation bits on every byte in a loop, the trailing zeros in Byte 0 tell the CPU the exact byte width (1, 2, 4, or 9 bytes) right away via <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Find_first_set" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="doc-link"><code>TZCNT</code></a>, reading the whole integer at once (<strong>2x to 4x faster</strong> on single integers and <strong>~35% faster</strong> on mixed integer streams than Go's <code>protowire</code> and <code>vtprotobuf</code>). Signed integers use <a href="https://protobuf.dev/programming-guides/encoding/#signed-ints" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="doc-link">ZigZag encoding</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-6">
        <div class="p-4 bg-ink text-paper border-2 border-ink rounded-md font-mono text-sm sm:text-base grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between bg-[#1F1F1F] px-3.5 py-2 rounded border border-paper/15">
            <span>
              <span class="text-paper/75">vvvvvvv</span>
              <strong class="text-acid">1</strong>
            </span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-acid text-ink font-bold rounded text-xs sm:text-sm">
              1B (7b)
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between bg-[#1F1F1F] px-3.5 py-2 rounded border border-paper/15">
            <span>
              <span class="text-paper/75">vvvvvv</span>
              <strong class="text-acid">10</strong>
            </span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-acid text-ink font-bold rounded text-xs sm:text-sm">
              2B (14b)
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between bg-[#1F1F1F] px-3.5 py-2 rounded border border-paper/15">
            <span>
              <span class="text-paper/75">vvvvv</span>
              <strong class="text-acid">100</strong>
            </span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-acid text-ink font-bold rounded text-xs sm:text-sm">
              4B (29b)
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between bg-[#1F1F1F] px-3.5 py-2 rounded border border-paper/15">
            <span>
              <strong class="text-acid">00000000</strong>
            </span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-paper/20 text-paper font-bold rounded text-xs sm:text-sm">
              9B (64b)
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Row 2: Single-Pass Encoding -->
    <div class="py-8 sm:py-10 grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 lg:gap-8 items-center">
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-2.5 min-w-0">
        <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight leading-snug">
          Reserve 2 bytes &amp; patch after
        </h3>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-ink/85 leading-relaxed max-w-[65ch]">
          Protobuf requires shortest-length varints, so encoders must measure every child object
          before writing. In OmniBuf, a 2-byte Prefix-Varint (<code>TZCNT=1</code>) is valid for any
          length under 16 KB, so the encoder reserves 2 bytes, writes forward in one pass, and fills
          in the length at the end (automatically expanding in place to 4 or 9 bytes if a container
          exceeds 16 KB).
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-6">
        <div class="p-4 bg-ink text-paper border-2 border-ink rounded-md font-mono text-sm grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <div class="bg-[#1F1F1F] p-3 rounded border border-paper/15">
            <div class="text-paper/75 text-xs mb-1.5">1. Reserve 2-byte blank slot</div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm">
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-paper/20 rounded">Tag #9</span>
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 border border-dashed border-acid text-acid font-bold rounded">
                [00 00]
              </span>
              <span class="text-paper/70">&rarr; write</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-[#1F1F1F] p-3 rounded border border-paper/15">
            <div class="text-paper/75 text-xs mb-1.5">2. Backpatch 2B length at end</div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm">
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-paper/20 rounded">Tag #9</span>
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-acid text-ink font-bold rounded">Len=7B</span>
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-[#FF4F18] text-white font-bold rounded">[7B]</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Row 3: 4-Bit Self-Describing Tags + Header Hopping (Merged with Skip Containers in One Step) -->
    <div class="py-8 sm:py-10 space-y-6">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 lg:gap-8 items-start">
        <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-2.5 min-w-0">
          <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight leading-snug">
            0-byte bools, explicit types &amp; 1-step skipping
          </h3>
          <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-ink/85 leading-relaxed max-w-[65ch]">
            Widening wire types from 3 bits to 4 bits (<code>0..15</code>) puts booleans directly
            inside the tag byte (<strong>0 value bytes</strong>), distinguishes unsigned (
            <code>WireUint</code>, <code>WireUintArr</code>) from ZigZag-signed (
            <code>WireSint</code>, <code>WireSintArr</code>) integers on the wire, and wraps all
            arrays, maps, and sub-messages in length-prefixed containers so readers can skip any
            field or container in a single step (<code>pos += byteLen</code>).
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="lg:col-span-6 min-w-0">
          <div class="p-4 bg-ink text-paper border-2 border-ink rounded-md font-mono text-sm space-y-3">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-12 text-center text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold rounded overflow-hidden border border-paper/30">
              <div class="col-span-5 bg-paper/15 py-2 text-paper border-r border-paper/30">
                Field #
              </div>
              <div class="col-span-5 bg-acid text-ink py-2 border-r border-ink">4-Bit Type</div>
              <div class="col-span-2 bg-[#FF4F18] text-white font-bold py-2">TZ</div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-paper/90">
              <span>
                <code>Type 1, 2</code> (Bool): <strong class="text-acid">0 Value Bytes</strong>
              </span>
              <span>
                Skip Container: <strong class="text-acid">pos += byteLen</strong>
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Schema + Explanation + Color Key -->
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-5 items-center bg-[#FAF8F2] border-2 border-ink rounded-md p-5">
        <div class="lg:col-span-5 font-mono min-w-0">
          <div class="bg-ink text-paper p-4 rounded text-sm leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto [&>pre]:!bg-transparent [&>pre]:!p-0 [&>pre]:!m-0 [&>pre]:!border-0">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-2.5 pb-2 border-b border-paper/15">
              <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase text-acid">node.proto</div>
              <button
                type="button"
                data-copy={nodeSchemaCode}
                class="copy-snippet-btn min-w-[4.75rem] text-center px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase bg-paper/15 hover:bg-acid hover:text-ink focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-acid text-paper border border-paper/30 rounded shrink-0 transition"
              >
                Copy
              </button>
            </div>
            <Code code={nodeSchemaCode} lang="protobuf" theme="github-dark" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-3 min-w-0">
          <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-ink/90 leading-relaxed">
            To skip past <code>id</code> (a 2-byte tag + 4-byte integer) and <code>active</code> (a
            boolean) to reach <code>city</code>, Protobuf has to bounce across{' '}
            <strong>every single varint byte</strong> to check continuation bits. OmniBuf reads the
            width from the first byte and leaps over each tag, scalar, or container in one jump.
          </p>
          <!-- Simple Color Key -->
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-xs sm:text-sm font-mono pt-1">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-2 font-bold">
              <span class="w-4 h-4 bg-ink inline-block border border-ink rounded-sm"></span> Tag
              Byte
            </span>
            <span class="flex items-center gap-2 font-bold">
              <span class="w-4 h-4 bg-[#E5E0D5] inline-block border border-ink rounded-sm"></span>{' '}
              Value Byte
            </span>
            <span class="flex items-center gap-2 font-bold">
              <span class="w-4 h-4 bg-acid inline-block border border-ink rounded-sm"></span> Target
              Field
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Flagship Header-Hopping Diagram inside .os-window -->
      <div class="os-window overflow-hidden">
        <div class="os-titlebar bg-[#E5E0D5]">
          <span class="font-mono text-sm sm:text-base font-bold uppercase">
            Varint Bouncing (8 Stops) vs. Header Hopping (3 Jumps)
          </span>
          <div class="os-stripes"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-3 sm:p-6">
          <!-- DESKTOP SVG: Side-by-Side Byte Strips with Bouncing vs Leaping Arrows -->
          <div class="hidden md:block">
            <svg
              viewBox="0 0 860 390"
              class="w-full h-auto select-none"
              role="img"
              aria-label="Comparison of Protobuf byte-by-byte varint bouncing versus OmniBuf header hopping"
            >
              <defs>
                <marker
                  id="hop-proto"
                  viewBox="0 0 10 10"
                  refX="9"
                  refY="5"
                  markerWidth="5.5"
                  markerHeight="5.5"
                  orient="auto"
                >
                  <path d="M 0 1 L 10 5 L 0 9 z" fill="#FF4F18" />
                </marker>
                <marker
                  id="hop-omni"
                  viewBox="0 0 10 10"
                  refX="9"
                  refY="5"
                  markerWidth="6"
                  markerHeight="6"
                  orient="auto"
                >
                  <path d="M 0 1 L 10 5 L 0 9 z" fill="#111111" />
                </marker>
              </defs>

              <!-- ============================================================ -->
              <!-- TRACK 1: PROTOBUF (8 Byte-by-Byte Bounces)                   -->
              <!-- ============================================================ -->
              <text
                x="20"
                y="26"
                fill="#FF4F18"
                font-family="IBM Plex Mono"
                font-size="14"
                font-weight="700"
              >
                PROTOBUF: Bounces on every varint byte to check continuation bits (8 stops)
              </text>

              <!-- 8 Bouncing Arcs (Separated from start/end stop dots) -->
              <!-- Bounce 1: Tag B1 (55) -> Tag B2 (141) -->
              <path
                d="M 62 91 Q 98 52 131 89"
                fill="none"
                stroke="#FF4F18"
                stroke-width="2.5"
                marker-end="url(#hop-proto)"
              />
              <!-- Bounce 2: Tag B2 (141) -> Int B1 (227) -->
              <path
                d="M 148 91 Q 184 52 217 89"
                fill="none"
                stroke="#FF4F18"
                stroke-width="2.5"
                marker-end="url(#hop-proto)"
              />
              <!-- Bounce 3: Int B1 (227) -> Int B2 (313) -->
              <path
                d="M 234 91 Q 270 52 303 89"
                fill="none"
                stroke="#FF4F18"
                stroke-width="2.5"
                marker-end="url(#hop-proto)"
              />
              <!-- Bounce 4: Int B2 (313) -> Int B3 (399) -->
              <path
                d="M 320 91 Q 356 52 389 89"
                fill="none"
                stroke="#FF4F18"
                stroke-width="2.5"
                marker-end="url(#hop-proto)"
              />
              <!-- Bounce 5: Int B3 (399) -> Int B4 (485) -->
              <path
                d="M 406 91 Q 442 52 475 89"
                fill="none"
                stroke="#FF4F18"
                stroke-width="2.5"
                marker-end="url(#hop-proto)"
              />
              <!-- Bounce 6: Int B4 (485) -> Bool Tag (571) -->
              <path
                d="M 492 91 Q 528 52 561 89"
                fill="none"
                stroke="#FF4F18"
                stroke-width="2.5"
                marker-end="url(#hop-proto)"
              />
              <!-- Bounce 7: Bool Tag (571) -> Bool Val (657) -->
              <path
                d="M 578 91 Q 614 52 647 89"
                fill="none"
                stroke="#FF4F18"
                stroke-width="2.5"
                marker-end="url(#hop-proto)"
              />
              <!-- Bounce 8: Bool Val (657) -> Target (743) -->
              <path
                d="M 664 91 Q 700 52 733 89"
                fill="none"
                stroke="#FF4F18"
                stroke-width="2.5"
                marker-end="url(#hop-proto)"
              />

              <!-- Bounce Stop Dots (Distinct cream/ink fill so orange arrows never blend in) -->
              <circle cx="55" cy="95" r="4" fill="#FAF8F2" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" />
              <circle cx="141" cy="95" r="4" fill="#FAF8F2" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" />
              <circle cx="227" cy="95" r="4" fill="#FAF8F2" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" />
              <circle cx="313" cy="95" r="4" fill="#FAF8F2" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" />
              <circle cx="399" cy="95" r="4" fill="#FAF8F2" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" />
              <circle cx="485" cy="95" r="4" fill="#FAF8F2" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" />
              <circle cx="571" cy="95" r="4" fill="#FAF8F2" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" />
              <circle cx="657" cy="95" r="4" fill="#FAF8F2" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" />
              <circle cx="743" cy="95" r="4" fill="#D4FF33" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" />

              <!-- Protobuf Byte Cells (y=102, h=52, w=78, gap=8) -->
              <!-- Cell 0: Tag B1 -->
              <rect
                x="16"
                y="102"
                width="78"
                height="52"
                rx="5"
                fill="#111111"
                stroke="#111111"
                stroke-width="2"
              />
              <text
                x="55"
                y="125"
                fill="#FAF8F2"
                font-family="IBM Plex Mono"
                font-size="13"
                font-weight="700"
                text-anchor="middle"
              >
                Tag B1
              </text>
              <text
                x="55"
                y="143"
                fill="#FF4F18"
                font-family="IBM Plex Mono"
                font-size="11"
                font-weight="600"
                text-anchor="middle"
              >
                more? 1
              </text>

              <!-- Cell 1: Tag B2 -->
              <rect
                x="102"
                y="102"
                width="78"
                height="52"
                rx="5"
                fill="#111111"
                stroke="#111111"
                stroke-width="2"
              />
              <text
                x="141"
                y="125"
                fill="#FAF8F2"
                font-family="IBM Plex Mono"
                font-size="13"
                font-weight="700"
                text-anchor="middle"
              >
                Tag B2
              </text>
              <text
                x="141"
                y="143"
                fill="#D4FF33"
                font-family="IBM Plex Mono"
                font-size="11"
                font-weight="600"
                text-anchor="middle"
              >
                end: 0
              </text>

              <!-- Cell 2: Int B1 -->
              <rect
                x="188"
                y="102"
                width="78"
                height="52"
                rx="5"
                fill="#E5E0D5"
                stroke="#111111"
                stroke-width="2"
              />
              <text
                x="227"
                y="125"
                fill="#111111"
                font-family="IBM Plex Mono"
                font-size="13"
                font-weight="700"
                text-anchor="middle"
              >
                Int B1
              </text>
              <text
                x="227"
                y="143"
                fill="#FF4F18"
                font-family="IBM Plex Mono"
                font-size="11"
                font-weight="700"
                text-anchor="middle"
              >
                more? 1
              </text>

              <!-- Cell 3: Int B2 -->
              <rect
                x="274"
                y="102"
                width="78"
                height="52"
                rx="5"
                fill="#E5E0D5"
                stroke="#111111"
                stroke-width="2"
              />
              <text
                x="313"
                y="125"
                fill="#111111"
                font-family="IBM Plex Mono"
                font-size="13"
                font-weight="700"
                text-anchor="middle"
              >
                Int B2
              </text>
              <text
                x="313"
                y="143"
                fill="#FF4F18"
                font-family="IBM Plex Mono"
                font-size="11"
                font-weight="700"
                text-anchor="middle"
              >
                more? 1
              </text>

              <!-- Cell 4: Int B3 -->
              <rect
                x="360"
                y="102"
                width="78"
                height="52"
                rx="5"
                fill="#E5E0D5"
                stroke="#111111"
                stroke-width="2"
              />
              <text
                x="399"
                y="125"
                fill="#111111"
                font-family="IBM Plex Mono"
                font-size="13"
                font-weight="700"
                text-anchor="middle"
              >
                Int B3
              </text>
              <text
                x="399"
                y="143"
                fill="#FF4F18"
                font-family="IBM Plex Mono"
                font-size="11"
                font-weight="700"
                text-anchor="middle"
              >
                more? 1
              </text>

              <!-- Cell 5: Int B4 -->
              <rect
                x="446"
                y="102"
                width="78"
                height="52"
                rx="5"
                fill="#E5E0D5"
                stroke="#111111"
                stroke-width="2"
              />
              <text
                x="485"
                y="125"
                fill="#111111"
                font-family="IBM Plex Mono"
                font-size="13"
                font-weight="700"
                text-anchor="middle"
              >
                Int B4
              </text>
              <text
                x="485"
                y="143"
                fill="#111111"
                font-family="IBM Plex Mono"
                font-size="11"
                font-weight="600"
                text-anchor="middle"
              >
                end: 0
              </text>

              <!-- Cell 6: Bool Tag -->
              <rect
                x="532"
                y="102"
                width="78"
                height="52"
                rx="5"
                fill="#111111"
                stroke="#111111"
                stroke-width="2"
              />
              <text
                x="571"
                y="125"
                fill="#FAF8F2"
                font-family="IBM Plex Mono"
                font-size="13"
                font-weight="700"
                text-anchor="middle"
              >
                Tag
              </text>
              <text
                x="571"
                y="143"
                fill="#FAF8F2"
                font-family="IBM Plex Mono"
                font-size="11"
                text-anchor="middle"
              >
                bool
              </text>

              <!-- Cell 7: Bool Val -->
              <rect
                x="618"
                y="102"
                width="78"
                height="52"
                rx="5"
                fill="#E5E0D5"
                stroke="#111111"
                stroke-width="2"
              />
              <text
                x="657"
                y="125"
                fill="#111111"
                font-family="IBM Plex Mono"
                font-size="13"
                font-weight="700"
                text-anchor="middle"
              >
                Bool
              </text>
              <text
                x="657"
                y="143"
                fill="#111111"
                font-family="IBM Plex Mono"
                font-size="11"
                text-anchor="middle"
              >
                1 byte
              </text>

              <!-- Cell 8: Target -->
              <rect
                x="704"
                y="102"
                width="140"
                height="52"
                rx="5"
                fill="#D4FF33"
                stroke="#111111"
                stroke-width="2.5"
              />
              <text
                x="774"
                y="125"
                fill="#111111"
                font-family="IBM Plex Mono"
